{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-four-seasons-private-residences-jumeirah","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"four-seasons-private-residences-jumeirah","about":"Discover the epitome of luxurious living at the Four Seasons Private Residences Dubai, located along the scenic Dubai Water Canal. This prestigious development, designed by the renowned French designer Sybille de Margerie, offers a unique blend of breathtaking water views and direct access to the canal promenade. For those looking to invest, Four Seasons Private Residences Jumeirah for sale presents a rare opportunity. The complex boasts 27 elegantly furnished apartments with 2 to 4-bedroom layout, in addition to exquisite 4 and 5-bedroom townhouses, making it a sought-after destination for those searching for Four Seasons Residences Dubai for sale or considering Four Seasons Private Residences Jumeirah apartments for rent.Residents will experience the unmatched level of service synonymous with the Four Seasons brand. The architectural design of the residences, noted for its elegant and modern features such as horizontal balconies and distinctive shading, stands as a hallmark of luxury. This development is not just a residence; it's a statement of upscale living, ideally positioned close to the Four Seasons Resort Jumeirah Beach, offering Four Seasons Private Residences Jumeirah rent options for those seeking unparalleled luxury.As the city's most prestigious address, the standalone Four Seasons Private Residences at Jumeirah encompasses an exclusive collection of 28 residences, penthouses, and villas, all overlooking the Dubai Water Canal. Each element, from the detailed marble inlays to the hand-selected art installations in the lobby, has been thoughtfully curated to meet the expectations of those who seek nothing but the best.","price":19000000,"title":"Four Seasons Private Residences Jumeirah","bitrix":{"id":377